<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia Nov manufacturing output prices up.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia Nov manufacturing output prices up.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia's manufacturing output prices rose 0.1 percent in November to be 0.4 percent up on the year, the Australian Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>Manufacturing output prices (base 1988/89):</p>
<p>				    Index   mth/mth pct  yr/yr pct</p>
<p>    November		    121.5     +0.1	 +0.4</p>
<p>    October		     121.4     +0.2	 +0.8</p>
<p>    November 1995	     121.0     +0.5	 +3.2</p>
<p>Note - The bureau said price increases for petrolum products were the main contributor to the rise in the index. Small price falls for a range of index items, including food, textiles and chemicals, tempered the increase.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
